%--
The book's home page: its title a heading that takes no number (front, the
book's module). The contents are references: the engine gives each entry
its number, title and link; "toc" is a reference form the page declares.
--%

#use("lib/book.mjs")
#{ $.element('heading', {forms: {toc: [slot('supplement'), slot('number'), ' ', slot('title')]}}) }
#heading(1, "home", {role: "front"})[测试书]

一本最小的测试书，只用来验收书籍栏目。

- @preface
- #ref("ch-a", {form: "toc"})
- #ref("ch-b", {form: "toc"})
- #ref("ch-c", {form: "toc"})
